        "review_1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"By week three she was putting weight on the leg again.\"",
            "details": "The vet said my Golden needed surgery or she'd suffer for the rest of her life. I couldn't afford it and I couldn't sleep. I tried these as a last resort: by month two she was stealing socks off the floor and running away with them. She hadn't done that in months. I actually cried.",
