        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.9",
            "quote": "\"At the follow-up, the vet said surgery wasn't urgent anymore.\"",
            "details": "My corgi was diagnosed with a full CCL rupture and quoted $6,000 we didn't have. I started her on these while we figured out financing. Three months later her mobility had improved so much the conversation changed. She takes the porch steps on her own and I haven't heard her cry getting up in weeks.",
