    "collapsible_content_TCEeNz": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_kP7dka": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will this replace surgery or my vet?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, and we won't pretend otherwise. StrideBack™ is built to support <strong>conservative management</strong>: the non-surgical path many dog parents choose with their vet. Keep your vet in the loop; bring the ingredient list to your next visit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jgAFHc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why not just plain glucosamine?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Because delivery is the choke point: the CCL has the worst blood supply in your dog's body. Glucosamine that never reaches the ligament can't help it. The stack pairs the rebuilders with <strong>piperine for absorption and curcumin for the immune overreaction</strong>: the parts generic chews skip.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qUEDkw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will I see something?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>In the reviews, the earliest signs show around <strong>weeks 2 to 3</strong>: a softer morning cry, weight shifting back. Bigger changes tend to land in months 2 to 3. Consistency matters more than anything, and the first 30 days are covered by the guarantee.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FCYENr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "My dog is picky. Will they actually eat it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>They're soft, palatable chews designed to be given <strong>like a treat</strong>, not hidden like a pill. Most dogs take them straight from your hand. If yours refuses, the 30-day guarantee has you covered.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JXE9KX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What size and age of dog is this for?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Every size and life stage.</strong> Dosing scales by weight: 1 chew for small dogs, 2 for medium, 3 for large. Senior dogs and big breeds, the ones most prone to CCL trouble, are exactly who it was built for.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xwHJdL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and returns?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Free tracked shipping.</strong> Every batch is third-party tested before release, so allow the delivery window shown at checkout. And you're covered: <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>, simple return, full refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
